Installation:

- Put the files in the appropriate directories in the internal drive of your 
  psion (the same they are in now).
- Compile the two OPL-Files
- You should get tsmp.opa in /app/. Install it.

The two asm-files are just posted for the case you need the source files.
The file s3obj.opl is taken from the s3asm2 package, the sys$samp.ldd from
the tsmp10 package and I included them just for your convenience.

Have fun and make good music!
Stefan
